{"event":"changes_requested","job_id":"docs-payment-methods-alipay-plus-api-only","reason":"Full 508-line pinned raw and SHA-256 verified, with all five quotes exact at their cited lines; receipt, candidate, suggestions, Q1/Q2 and concept route checked. The candidate carefully records several source conflicts but omits two material ones. The high-level sequence puts shopper wallet selection before the form and payment request (raw lines 33-37), whereas the redirect section puts selection on the Alipay+ checkout page after the generic payment request (lines 324-349). The requirements say add Alipay+ in Customer Area (line 29), while the live prerequisite says submit a request for Alipay (line 504). A reader asking when to offer wallet choice or which method to request for live setup could receive an unjustifiably certain answer from the current source entry. No other material blockers found."}
